+# Phase 11 Final Report ΓÇö CRM Core Foundation
+
+**Decision:** **READY_FOR_PHASE_12_WITH_BLOCKERS**
+
+**Date:** 2026-07-30
+
+**Working tree:** Phase 11 Waves 0ΓÇô4 delivered in-place on branch `v2` (no git commit required for Wave 4 exit).
+
+CRM Core is shippable for authorised System Admin users as a **dedicated CrmLead / CrmAccount / CrmContact plane** (Γëá Customer Γëá SupportTicket Γëá CsCase Γëá Tenant Client Γëá POS `sales.*`): numbering + state machine, idempotent public/handoff capture, duplicate candidates, versioned qualification, deterministic explainable scoring (not probability/Revenue), teams/territories/assignment, consent/DNC eligibility, timeline/notes/tasks foundations, controlled merge with SoD, opportunity-readiness handoff payload (**never creates Opportunity**), My Work / lead list / lead detail UI, and import/report/Email/WhatsApp foundation contracts.
+
+## Delivered
+
+| Wave | Focus | Status |
+|------|-------|--------|
+| 0 | Forensic audits + matrices + CONDITIONAL GO | Done |
+| 1 | Account / Contact / Lead + numbering + status SM + APIs | Done |
+| 2 | Public capture + handoffs ΓåÆ Lead + duplicate candidates | Done |
+| 3 | Qualification + scoring + ownership/territories + consent/DNC | Done |
+| 4 | Timeline/tasks/notes + merge + readiness + UI + Phase 12 pack | Done |
+
+## Surfaces (Wave 4)
+
+### Libraries
+
+- `lib/admin/crm/timeline.js` ΓÇö paginated timeline events (Γëá Support/CS threads)
+- `lib/admin/crm/notes.js` ΓÇö INTERNAL / RESTRICTED notes; restricted projection API-enforced
+- `lib/admin/crm/tasks.js` ΓÇö TODO ΓåÆ COMPLETED only (no sales sequences)
+- `lib/admin/crm/merge.js` ΓÇö request / approve / execute; SoD requester Γëá approver; evidence preserved
+- `lib/admin/crm/opportunityReadiness.js` ΓÇö checklist ΓåÆ NOT_READY|PARTIALLY_READY|READY|BLOCKED; typed handoff; **never creates Opportunity**
+- `lib/admin/crm/reconciliation.js`, `export.js`, `foundations.js` ΓÇö light recon/export; FOUNDATION / NOT_AVAILABLE honesty
+
+### Prisma / SQL
+
+- `CrmTimelineEvent`, `CrmNote`, `CrmTask`, `CrmMergeRequest`, `CrmReconciliationRun`, `CrmExportAudit`
+- `CrmLead.mergedIntoLeadId`
+- Fallback: `scripts/sql/crm-core-phase11-wave4.sql`
+
+### APIs
+
+- Timeline / notes / tasks (+ complete)
+- Merge request / approve / execute
+- Opportunity readiness (POST)
+- Reconciliation / export / foundations
+
+### UI
+
+- `/insightbooks/crm` ΓåÆ My Work; lead list + detail; thin stubs for accounts/contacts/duplicates/imports/settings
+- Reports + foundations views; section nav + i18n (en/ny)
+- Channel badges: EMAIL / WHATSAPP = NOT_AVAILABLE
+- Score copy: ΓÇ£Lead fit scoreΓÇ¥ ΓÇö never probability
+
+## Hard rules preserved
+
+- Lead Γëá Opportunity Γëá Customer Γëá Support Ticket Γëá CsCase
+- CRM Account may link to Customer; must not duplicate billing/MRR truth
+- Contact Γëá Platform User
+- Capture idempotent; consent never inferred; DNC via eligibility
+- Qualification Γëá scoring; score Γëá win probability; no AI scoring
+- No silent merges; SoD on merge approval
+- Email / WhatsApp Lead ingest remain `NOT_AVAILABLE` + contracts
+- Tenant POS `sales.*` is WRONG_DOMAIN
+- System CoA admin route stays removed
+
+## Verification
+
+```bash
+npx vitest run \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.wave4.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.qualification.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.scoring.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.assignment.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.consent.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.leads.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.capture.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.crm.duplicates.test.js
+```
+
+**Result (2026-07-30):** Test Files 8 passed (8) ┬╖ Tests 60 passed (60)
+
+## Known blockers for Phase 12
+
+1. **Email ΓåÆ Lead ingest** ΓÇö channel contract `NOT_AVAILABLE` (no invented inbound volume)
+2. **WhatsApp ΓåÆ Lead ingest** ΓÇö deferred; same honesty gate
+3. **Full CRM import tooling** ΓÇö FOUNDATION only; no fake import success metrics
+4. **Full CRM reporting / dashboards** ΓÇö FOUNDATION; export JSON/CSV only
+5. **Opportunity / Pipeline / forecasting / proposals** ΓÇö NOT_AVAILABLE in Phase 11 create scope; readiness handoff only
+6. **Lead ΓåÆ Tenant conversion transaction** ΓÇö CARRY (human Tenant create today)
+7. **Account/Contact merge UI depth** ΓÇö Lead merge executed; Account/Contact merge deferred (`NOT_AVAILABLE`)
+8. **Rich Accounts/Contacts/Duplicates admin UI** ΓÇö thin stubs; APIs exist
+9. **Owner/team/territory list scope filtering** ΓÇö `resolveCrmScope` still `mode: 'all'` stub
+10. **Prisma generate / db push on Windows** ΓÇö schema + SQL ready; apply when EPERM clears
+
+## Exit readiness
+
+**READY_FOR_PHASE_12_WITH_BLOCKERS** ΓÇö CRM Core Waves 1ΓÇô4 are honest and gated for capture, qualification, scoring, ownership, consent, merge SoD, opportunity-readiness handoff, and admin My Work/list/detail; Email/WhatsApp ingest, full import/reporting, and Opportunity create remain explicit blockers for treating CRM as revenue-pipeline-complete.
