+2. Pipeline stages + forecasting (no fabricated zeroes)
+3. Lead ΓåÆ Tenant conversion transaction (if in scope)
+4. Email / WhatsApp ingest contracts ΓåÆ producers (or keep NOT_AVAILABLE)
+5. Full import + reporting beyond JSON/CSV foundation
+6. Harden owner/team/territory list scope filtering
+
+## Carry gaps (from Phase 11 gap register)
+
+- G11-16 Email ΓåÆ Lead ingest (DEFERRED)
+- G11-17 WhatsApp ΓåÆ Lead (DEFERRED)
+- G11-23 Lead ΓåÆ Tenant conversion (CARRY)
+- G11-24 Opportunities / forecasting / proposals (CARRY ΓåÆ Phase 12+)
