+
+## Classification legend
+
+| Class | Meaning |
+|-------|---------|
+| READY | Usable as-designed for Phase 11 consumption |
+| PARTIAL | Exists but incomplete / not CRM-shaped |
+| NOT_FOUND | Absent in codebase / schema |
